    {
      "description": "Endpoints mounted at /api/v1/onramp.\nPowered by the Transak integration.\n\nFlow:\n1. Create Widget URL -> open URL in browser to complete payment\n2. Transak calls the Webhook endpoint automatically on status changes\n3. Poll Get Transaction to check final status",
      "name": "Onramp",
      "item": [
        {
          "request": {
            "url": {
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onramp/widget-url",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "onramp",
                "widget-url"
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "raw": "{\n  \"walletId\": \"{{circleWalletId}}\",\n  \"fiatCurrency\": \"USD\",\n  \"fiatAmount\": 50\n}",
              "mode": "raw"
            },
            "description": "Creates a pending on-ramp transaction and returns a Transak widget URL.\n\nPrerequisites:\n- User must have an active Circle USDC wallet (stored in {{circleWalletId}})\n- SERVER .env must have CLIENT_ORIGIN set (e.g. http://localhost:3000)\n- The Origin header must match CLIENT_ORIGIN exactly -- add {{clientOrigin}} env var\n\nBody: { walletId (required), fiatCurrency? (3-letter, default: USD), fiatAmount (required, positive, max 1000000) }\nResponse: { transaction: {...}, widgetUrl: 'https://...' }",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Origin",
                "value": "{{clientOrigin}}"
              }
            ]
          },
          "name": "Create Onramp Widget URL",
          "event": [
            {
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.transaction && res.transaction._id) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('onrampTransactionId', res.transaction._id);",
                  "  console.log('onrampTransactionId saved:', res.transaction._id);",
                  "}",
                  "if (res.widgetUrl) {",
                  "  console.log('Open in browser:', res.widgetUrl);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              },
              "listen": "test"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Onramp Transaction",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onramp/transactions/{{onrampTransactionId}}",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "onramp",
                "transactions",
                "{{onrampTransactionId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Fetches the current status of an on-ramp transaction.\nPath param: transactionId -- auto-saved as {{onrampTransactionId}} by the Create Widget URL request.\n\nResponse: { transaction: { status, amount, sourceAmount, sourceCurrency, transakStatus, ... } }"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Transak Webhook (Simulate)",
          "request": {
            "body": {
              "raw": "{\n  \"data\": \"<paste_transak_webhook_jwt_here>\"\n}",
              "mode": "raw"
            },
            "description": "Receives Transak order status webhooks (no Firebase auth -- verified via HMAC JWT).\n\nIn production Transak calls this automatically. Use only for manual local simulation.\n\nStatus mappings (eventID -> app status):\n  ORDER_CREATED -> pending\n  ORDER_PAYMENT_VERIFYING -> processing\n  ORDER_PROCESSING -> processing\n  ORDER_COMPLETED -> completed\n  ORDER_FAILED -> failed\n  ORDER_REFUNDED -> cancelled\n  ORDER_EXPIRED -> cancelled",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "url": {
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onramp/webhooks/transak",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "onramp",
                "webhooks",
                "transak"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
